                <p>DOK-ING's innovative new robotic system KOMODO, equipped with PMA cable protection, is a unique unmanned ground system (UGS).</p>
                <p>The hybrid propulsion system is able to operate in extreme conditions such as chemical, biological, and radiological (CBR) contaminated zones, with low oxygen levels and high temperatures. Tasks include surveying, reconnaissance, patrolling, CBR detection and surveillance under a wide variety of terrain and detectors and advanced video systems. Real-time data collection, processing and analysis provide the</p>
